WEBVTT

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:50.960
Okay, guess I'll go to sleep now.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.690
Momo?!

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:17.680
Yo!

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:21.350
