<b>m 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 117 286 143 269 181 273 b 153 295 177 318 193 314 b 176 321 172 328 172 342 b 166 328 152 327 142 348 b 150 304 130 304 97 324  </b>

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:21.350
<b>「Ghost story</b>

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:21.350
<b>「Ghost story</b>

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:21.350
<b>~Do you like scary things?~」</b>

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:21.350
<b>~Do you like scary things?~」</b>

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:21.350
It's still to early to sleep, manservant.

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:26.690
N-Nemesis?!

00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:28.810
W-Why are you in my room?!

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:31.020
There's no reason to be so surprised.

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:34.640
My room and my manservant's are one and the same.

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:37.120
W-Why are you here...?

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:42.680
I was killing time by checking out the local book store,

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:47.290
but I came across what seems to be a seasonal
tradition this country has called "ghost stories".

00:01:47.660 --> 00:01:48.880
Ghost stories?

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:52.330
Using words to bring terror to people.

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:54.270
To be honest, I'm really interested.

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:56.130
And so...

00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:58.880
Tell me a scary story!

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:01.540
Go on.

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:02.390
Huh?!

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:05.240
Hurry up, manservant, or I'll step on you!

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:08.390
Even if you say that...

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:10.900
In that case, I'll do it, Rito-san.

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:17.790
Momo, why were you in a place like that?

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:21.370
Rito-san, you don't have to do what Nemesis tells you to.

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:23.620
You're not her manservant.

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:25.580
I thought I sensed somebody's presence.

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:27.270
So it was you, Princess Momo?

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:29.880
Were you planning to attack Yuuki Rito in his sleep?

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:32.100
It doesn't matter why I'm here!

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:33.630
So unfriendly.

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:35.150
Well, that's fine.

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:37.150
Let's hear it then.

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:39.840
A scary story that will make me tremble.

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:41.640
Fine.

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:44.850
Once you've heard it, please leave.

00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:56.180
Now then, I'll tell you story I heard from Zastin-san when I was a child.

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:57.230
Go ahead.

00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:59.320
How did it turn into something like this?

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:10.090
Long ago, a young man travelling in space was forced to make an emergency landing...

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:13.960
...on a certain uncharted planet due to a mechanical failure on his ship.

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:20.490
He found nothing but a deep forest when he left his ship for help.

00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:25.420
He wandered the forest, frightened of the dark for three hours when suddenly,

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:32.600
he located an ancient{archaic-style} mansion.

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:39.060
Exhausted and looking for lodging, he knocked on the door.{The exhausted man, hoping to find lodging for the night, knocked on the door.}

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:41.730
Knock, knock.

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:44.040
And then...

00:03:47.930 --> 00:03:50.530
An old hag with pure white hair...!

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:51.330
Wait!

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:52.510
Eh?

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:55.000
I don't think it works like that.

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:59.500
Rather than a hag, wouldn't it be better if it were a young woman?

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:00.740
Shut up.

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:03.690
That's the kind of story it is, so just be quiet and listen.

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:11.150
Due to his exhaustion, the man fell asleep quickly after being led to a room.

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:16.670
But after feeling someone else's presence for some time,{But after some time, having the presence of another person...}

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:19.360
he slowly opened his eyes to find...

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:28.200
...the hag from earlier standing over his bed, staring at his face!

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:28.870
Wait!

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:33.040
In that case, wouldn't it be{ all the more} even better if it were a young woman?

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.200
I wonder about that...

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:36.380
That just might be.

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:37.880
Let's try it this way!

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:46.550
Before his eyes stood a young woman with her clothes open.

00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:55.140
The woman straddled the man,

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:04.130
and said with an enraptured gaze:

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:12.110
"Why don't I train you?"

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.630
That's just what you usually do, you damn sadist!

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:20.840
How dare you drip hot candle wax on Rito-san!

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:23.810
Then what should I drip on him?

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:25.050
What...?

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:38.480
Ouch, ouch...

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.530
Young traveller...?

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:46.060
You must be exhausted.{, right?}

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:05.760
The nectar these Milkea flowers secrete will not only make your skin beautiful...

00:06:32.010 --> 00:06:34.790
When it sinks deep into your skin,{It sinks deep into your skin...}

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:43.160
it has a rejuvenating effect and will erase your weariness.{ on your weariness.}

00:06:54.440 --> 00:07:00.230
I'll rub lots of it in for you.

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:07.860
Oh! You have some pretty good stuff to drip, Princess Momo!

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:09.170
Let's see...

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:18.190
Hey!

00:07:18.190 --> 00:07:20.570
There are enough people in this story already!

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:23.380
It's fine, isn't it? We can just say there were two women.

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:37.140
Y-You guys-

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:39.980
Isn't this good, traveller?

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:41.980
Wait, wait, wait! Hey!

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:45.930
Your skin will be as smooth as silk tomorrow morning.

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:49.570
Wait! Weren't you telling a ghost story?!

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:01.960
Em?

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:06.090
Hey, Rito, your sleep talking is a little-

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:12.240
Wha-?!

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:14.920
Momo-san, what are you do-

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:17.640
Wait, is that fluid-?!

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:20.350
I-It's not what it looks like, Mikan-san!

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:23.300
This is Milkea nectar, and Nemesis is-

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:25.550
Where is Nemesis?

00:08:25.550 --> 00:08:26.230
Eh?

00:08:26.890 --> 00:08:28.240
Huh?

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:28.900
Huh?!

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:32.200
No more excuses!

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:34.650
Both of you sit right there!

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:43.180
The scariest thing was his little sister.

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:46.000
Oh, so smooth!

