<b>m 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 117 286 143 269 181 273 b 153 295 177 318 193 314 b 176 321 172 328 172 342 b 166 328 152 327 142 348 b 150 304 130 304 97 324  </b>

00:08:57.950 --> 00:09:00.850
<b>「Clinic</b>

00:08:57.950 --> 00:09:00.850
<b>「Clinic</b>

00:08:57.950 --> 00:09:00.850
<b>~Can't be honest~」</b>

00:08:57.950 --> 00:09:00.850
<b>~Can't be honest~」</b>

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:02.490
So tell me one more time what you're here for, Yami-san?

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:03.550
Okay.

00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:04.690
Actually...

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:13.320
I came to apologise to the people who were inconvenienced in the earlier uproar.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:14.070
Okay.

00:09:14.640 --> 00:09:20.260
There's... someone I still haven't apologised to {properly }yet.

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:22.080
Hm? Who?

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:23.370
It's...

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.000
Could it be Tearju-san?

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.580
No... Tear is, um...

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:29.840
Just as I thought. You're so shy, Yami-san.

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:31.600
N-No, that's not it!

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:32.860
Hey, Mikan!

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:33.510
Ah...

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:36.020
Do you know where my wallet is?

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:37.700
Again?

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:41.170
Did you drop it in the bathroom?

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:43.550
Hm?

00:09:43.550 --> 00:09:47.430
Y-Yami... Welcome.

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:48.540
Thanks.

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:52.190
What's with the two of you?

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:55.540
O-Oh, that's right.

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:57.210
I have something I need to buy.

00:09:57.210 --> 00:10:00.000
Detergent. Yeah, I think we're out of detergent.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.470
I'm going out for a bit.

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:04.450
Don't you need your wallet?

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.500
Rito-san, Mikan-san!

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:09.500
Oshizu-san is on the phone.

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:14.900
It seems Mikado-sensei's clinic is pretty busy today,

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:16.880
and she wanted to know if you could help out a little.

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:20.620
Help out? Us?

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:22.270
But we're amateurs.

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:26.140
Even if you don't know anything about medicine, she's asking about something you can help with.{She said she wants to ask you for help with something you can do, even if you don't know anything about medicine.}

00:10:26.610 --> 00:10:28.340
What should we do?

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:29.390
Hm...

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:33.640
Now that I think about it,

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:36.310
Tearju-sensei is staying at Mikado-sensei's place, right?

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:39.210
Hm...? Yeah, that's true.

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:40.500
In that case...

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:58.050
Why did I have to come, too?

00:10:58.050 --> 00:10:59.730
Don't complain.

00:10:59.730 --> 00:11:02.330
It's important to help others out, Yami-san.

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:03.600
Thank you so much!

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:06.480
You'll be a big help!

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:10.570
It seems we'll also be considerably busy this afternoon.

00:11:10.570 --> 00:11:13.060
I'll be paying you, so please take care of me.

00:11:13.530 --> 00:11:14.920
Yes!

00:11:14.920 --> 00:11:17.890
Hey! You come out, too. Don't hide.

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:24.070
P-Please take care of me, Yami-chan.

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:27.580
Same here.

00:11:27.970 --> 00:11:29.900
So awkward...

00:11:29.900 --> 00:11:33.460
Mikado-sensei, we're all ready here as well.

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:41.330
Why do I have to be a girl?!

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:46.390
There aren't many chances to wear a nurse outfit, Riko-san.

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:49.850
Oh! You really can become a girl!

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:51.850
Only for a limited time, though.

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:54.440
That's nice.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:58.330
I'll have to examine that body thoroughly later.

00:11:58.330 --> 00:11:58.860
Eh?

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:00.330
Examination?

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:01.360
That's right.

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:05.900
Places like this and that...

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:08.490
Thoroughly...

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:19.600
That's a nice reaction.

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:28.200
Let's check your body temperature.

00:12:32.570 --> 00:12:36.020
Just like a baby, huh?

00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:41.030
Oh? Your heart rate is rising...?

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:42.940
Stop it...

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:48.290
Please stop it!

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:49.680
You're so cute.

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:52.730
Geez. Stop teasing her, Mikado-sensei!

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:53.500
Mikan...

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:54.970
Momo-san, you too.

00:12:54.970 --> 00:12:57.220
Please don't treat Rito like a toy all the time!

00:12:57.220 --> 00:12:59.660
Yes, I'm sorry.

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:05.760
Mikan, you're the only one I can rely on at a time like this...!

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:13.600
Let's give it our best, <i>Onee</i>-chan.

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:19.150
Mikan-san is a sadist when it comes to Rito-san.

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:20.400
Is that so...?

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:24.530
Momo, please don't give strange information to Tear.

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:31.540
Next!

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:34.410
Gokutsubu-san from planet Nito!

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:35.930
Here.

00:13:35.930 --> 00:13:37.370
This way, please.

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:39.260
What is it?

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:42.380
I seem to be overly{pretty badly} dehydrated.

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:46.340
Okay, I'll take your temperature.

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:49.180
Eh?

00:13:50.740 --> 00:13:52.140
Your mouth is there?!

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:53.600
Here you go.

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:55.230
Oh, so busy, so busy.

00:13:57.450 --> 00:13:58.540
W-What?!

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:01.270
Oops, I stumbled.

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:03.370
Wait- Just where are you touching?!

00:14:03.370 --> 00:14:04.610
I'm sorry.

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:07.970
I'm injured and my head hurts.

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:10.530
Will you give me your panties?!

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:11.950
I'm being sexually harassed!

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:15.150
You're injured, huh?

00:14:15.150 --> 00:14:16.500
That's terrible.

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:18.960
Fortunately this is a clinic.

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:23.140
So there's no problem if you have a few more injuries.

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:27.470
I-I'm sorry!

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:31.510
T-Thank you, Yami.

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:33.680
I didn't do it to save you.

00:14:34.210 --> 00:14:37.060
I just hate perverted things like that.

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:42.360
She really can't be honest...

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:44.960
Take care!

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:51.030
I'm so tired.

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:53.670
It looks like we finally have time to take a breather, huh?

00:14:53.670 --> 00:14:55.110
Seems that way.

00:14:55.110 --> 00:14:56.660
Ah, thank you.

00:14:58.450 --> 00:15:00.040
We're finally done.

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:06.840
By the way, Momo-chan, have you seen Tear?

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:07.630
No.

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:11.050
I asked her to take the unused medicine to the basement,

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:12.910
but I wonder what's taking her so long?

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:16.220
There are various things in the basement that have to be handled carefully, so...

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:20.560
She's a little scatterbrained, so I'm starting to get worried.

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.640
I'll take a look.

00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:23.560
Yami?

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:26.400
Me too?

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:29.700
Why did Yami-san take Rito-san?

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:35.160
She's probably worried about Tearju-san, but is too embarrassed to go alone.

00:15:43.970 --> 00:15:45.500
I'm relieved.

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:50.840
No matter how awkward it gets between you two,
you're still worried about Tearju-sensei, aren't you, Yami?{No matter how awkward it may be between you, you are worried about Tearju-sensei after all aren't you, Yami?}

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:52.820
Why do you ask all of a sudden?{What is this, suddenly?}

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:53.930
Ah, no reason.

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:57.560
I was just thinking of how the two of you are family.

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:00.660
Yuuki Rito.

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:01.390
Hm?

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:06.840
Um...

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:09.230
About what happened back then...

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:13.240
Um...

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:21.120
Um...

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:23.170
T-

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:24.470
Th-

00:16:24.470 --> 00:16:25.420
Tha-

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:26.710
Than-

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:44.100
Now I will examine your heartbeat.

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:45.950
Please do not move.

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:48.230
Please do not move.

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:49.900
Ah! It's cold!

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:51.030
Sensei!

00:16:51.390 --> 00:16:56.540
Yuuki-kun, Yami-chan! Save me!

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:56.540
What is that?!

00:16:56.540 --> 00:16:57.610
Ah!

00:16:57.610 --> 00:17:03.040
It's a medical robot that Doctor Mikado used as an assistant before coming to Earth.

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:05.290
It seems she hasn't disposed of it yet.

00:17:05.740 --> 00:17:12.290
I heard she bought it to try out, but it was basically useless due to how many issues it had from buying it second-hand.{ I headr it was of little use because it was a second-hand product that she bought just to try out and it had many malfunctions.}

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:15.300
W-Why did something like that suddenly activate?!

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:21.810
I-I accidentally tripped and pressed the switch!

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:24.310
Patients detected.

00:17:24.820 --> 00:17:26.690
Performing examination.

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:29.150
Please remove your clothes.

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:36.680
So this is how it got Tear's clothes.

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:39.580
Yami-chan!

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:40.120
Tear!

00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:44.580
Please run away while the mecha is busy with us-

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:48.120
Where are you dodging?!

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:50.630
Even if you say that, I'm desperate!

00:18:01.150 --> 00:18:02.760
Patients have fallen.

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:04.980
Performing first-aid.

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:15.530
What an unbelievably useless mecha.

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:19.910
Also Yuuki Rito, your hindrance is-

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:22.210
Ah!

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:27.580
Shameless!

00:18:26.610 --> 00:18:28.120
Are you really saying that?

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:29.870
Treating patients! Treating patients!

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:40.800
Yuuki-kun?!

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:47.630
Tear!

00:18:47.630 --> 00:18:49.420
I told you to run!

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:51.190
I-I'm sorry!

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:54.230
I couldn't move.

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:58.450
I don't want to leave you behind to save myself any more!

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:01.340
I don't want to make you experience something like that again.

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:05.220
Treating patients.

00:19:05.220 --> 00:19:06.580
Treating patients.

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:09.360
T-T-Treat-

00:19:09.360 --> 00:19:09.830
T-T-

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:16.760
Good grief.

00:19:24.270 --> 00:19:27.790
It's hard when there are so many hindrances.

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:57.760
Yami-san and the others sure are late...

00:19:57.760 --> 00:19:59.510
I wonder what they're doing?

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:02.710
Maybe they're having fun together?

00:20:03.420 --> 00:20:04.830
Right?

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:05.640
Eh?

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:07.510
Oh, Yami-san.

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:09.750
What's wrong?

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:11.370
Your face is red.

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:17.510
Returning to normal with that timing is against the rules.

00:20:17.510 --> 00:20:20.850
But I had no choice other than putting his clothes back on.

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:23.950
Huh?

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:28.090
Huh? Huh? Huh?

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:41.690
Beast.
